
---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Off The Grid"
  eyebrow="Est. 2026 — Arizona"
  description="Independent sports media. Real stories. Different perspectives."
>
  <div class="otg-studio">
    <p class="intro">
      More than media. More than the game.
    </p>

    <p class="statement">
      We're <strong>Off The Grid</strong> — an Arizona-based
      creative collective built on a shared passion for sports,
      storytelling, and the culture surrounding the game.
    </p>

    <p>
      Established in 2026, OTG was created with one vision:
      to shine a light on the athletes, moments, and stories
      that deserve to be seen. From the biggest plays to
      the moments nobody else catches, we're here to
      capture it all.
    </p>

    <h2>Beyond The Game.</h2>
    <p>
      We don't just cover sports. We capture the energy,
      the emotion, and everything that makes the game
      what it is. Through photography, sports media,
      and creative storytelling, we're building a platform
      that puts athletes and their stories first.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our mission is simple: elevate others, celebrate
      individuality, and give the next generation of
      athletes a platform to be seen.
    </p>

    <h2>Behind The Lens.</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Noah Augon</strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      Part of the creative vision behind Off The Grid.
      Driven by a passion for sports, creativity,
      and capturing moments that matter.
    </p>

    <h2>Let's Create Something.</h2>
    <p>
      Got a game coming up? Need a photoshoot?
      Have a story worth telling?
    </p>

    <p>
      Whether you're an athlete, a team, or a brand,
      we're always looking to create something different.
      Consider Off The Grid for your next shoot.
    </p>

    <a
      href="https://www.instagram.com/otg.us/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="instagram-link"
    >
      DM US ON INSTAGRAM ↗
    </a>

    <p class="closing">Stay Different. Stay Off The Grid.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=UnifrakturCook:wght@700&display=swap');

  /* Apply blackletter font to the main page title */
  :global(.page-header h1),
  :global(.page-title),
  :global(main h1) {
    font-family: 'UnifrakturCook', serif !important;
  }

  .otg-studio {
    max-width: 760px;
    padding: 15px 0 60px;
    color: #263f51;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .statement {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .otg-studio p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .otg-studio h2 {
    font-family: 'UnifrakturCook', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 45px 0 18px;
    color: #263f51;
  }

  .instagram-link {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 15px 25px;
    margin: 15px 0 35px;
    border: 2px solid #263f51;
    color: #263f51;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .instagram-link:hover {
    background: #263f51;
    color: #d8eaf5;
  }

  .closing {
    font-family: 'UnifrakturCook', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.8rem);
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
</style>
